OL,3,ALib Dem leader Ed Davey to warn of AI's
OL,4,A'existential threat' in conference
OL,5,Aspeech
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey will
OL,8,Fdeliver a speech later as he closes out
OL,9,Fhis party's autumn conference in
OL,10,FBrighton - watch live from around 14:30
OL,11,FBST
OL,13,FHe's expected to set out policies and
OL,14,Fspeak about the global development of
OL,15,FAI, and its "existential threat"
OL,17,FIn the run-up to his address, Davey
OL,18,Fsays there is no ceiling on Lib Dem
OL,19,Fambitions and that he's a "candidate to
OL,20,Fbe prime minister"
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
